WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.101 --> 00:00:05.001
One step up the magnitude scale multiplies the energy by about thirty two.

2
00:00:06.002 --> 00:00:09.002
Magnitude five is where we start counting.

3
00:00:09.805 --> 00:00:14.055
One step up, to six, is about thirty two times as much energy.

4
00:00:17.055 --> 00:00:19.605
The curve shoots off the top of the page.
